  "notes": "From English 'paint.' Used both for the substance (paint) and, with する, for the act of painting or coating something. Common in DIY, automotive, and design contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\n- ペイントする: to paint, to coat\n- {壁|かべ}をペイントする: to paint a wall\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ペンキ: paint — the everyday word for house paint (from Dutch)\n- {塗料|とりょう}: paint, coating material — a more technical term",
